1
00:00:14,712 --> 00:00:18,020
Tu as déjà fini tes devoirs ?
Have you already finished your homework?

2
00:00:18,120 --> 00:00:21,956
Oui, parce que c'était très facile.
Yes, because it was very easy.

3
00:00:22,056 --> 00:00:25,076
Tu travailles toujours ici ?
Do you still work here?

4
00:00:25,176 --> 00:00:28,748
Oui, et je peux aussi t'aider.
Yes, and I can help you too.

5
00:00:28,848 --> 00:00:33,524
Merci ! J'aime beaucoup ce café.
Thanks! I like this café a lot.

6
00:00:33,624 --> 00:00:37,436
Il est plus calme et moins bruyant le matin.
It's calmer and less noisy in the morning.

7
00:00:37,536 --> 00:00:40,292
Tu viens encore demain ?
Are you coming again tomorrow?

8
00:00:40,392 --> 00:00:45,548
Oui, sauf le dimanche : je ne viens jamais ce jour-là.
Yes, except on Sundays: I never come that day.
